### 4.3 list_conversations
The frame carries no user id and there is no field for one: the server lists the conversations of
the user its `WsAuthenticator` returned for that connection ([validated by: answers the connecting user's own conversations even when the frame names another user @94b283cd](../../src/transport/conversationList.test.ts#L126)). A `before` is accepted
only carrying both fields, since a cursor on a time alone skips a conversation when two share one
([validated by: refuses a cursor missing either half, or carrying a time nothing can parse, naming the field @b66027e2](../../src/transport/ws/validation.test.ts#L48)).
